        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a tiny car with one button. Evade cops, commuters, and chaos! Every press turns you left and every turn speeds you up. Battle it out with 10 cars at a time or beat single player challenges!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crowded Crossroads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around with <strong>1-10 players</strong> and watch your chaos pile up. Cops leave their wreck on the streets while commuters keep bouncing around. With the roads filling up and your car only accelerating, be the last one driving to get the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.poster.avif?t=1753117090\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.webm?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.mp4?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>20 special rounds</strong> that change up the game's rules. Play hotseat to get highscores for both the most and least distance driven. Completing certain challenges will unlock <strong>exciting events</strong> that can then occur in regular play too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.poster.avif?t=1753117090\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.webm?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.mp4?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play How You Want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally by using A-Z on your keyboard. Get a gamepad for each player or share one. Use any kind of controller you've got lying around or don't and use Remote Play Together instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't have 10 people? Don't fret! Every car without a player can also be <strong>controlled by CPU</strong>!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a tiny car with one button. Evade cops, commuters, and chaos! Every press turns you left and every turn speeds you up. Battle it out with 10 cars at a time or beat single player challenges!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crowded Crossroads</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around with <strong>1-10 players</strong> and watch your chaos pile up. Cops leave their wreck on the streets while commuters keep bouncing around. With the roads filling up and your car only accelerating, be the last one driving to get the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.poster.avif?t=1753117090\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.webm?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/e5b74c71b1c7024acfd3657f3778738d.mp4?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>20 special rounds</strong> that change up the game's rules. Play hotseat to get highscores for both the most and least distance driven. Completing certain challenges will unlock <strong>exciting events</strong> that can then occur in regular play too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.poster.avif?t=1753117090\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.webm?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952450/extras/9d6cbab70bfd395db13ad1c9b486c21b.mp4?t=1753117090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play How You Want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally by using A-Z on your keyboard. Get a gamepad for each player or share one. Use any kind of controller you've got lying around or don't and use Remote Play Together instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't have 10 people? Don't fret! Every car without a player can also be <strong>controlled by CPU</strong>!</p>",
